{
  "name": "Company Domain MX Record, Email Deliverability & 100+ Tech Stack Enricher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Company Domain MX Record, Email Deliverability & 100+ Tech Stack Enricher\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nEnrich raw company domains with DNS MX deliverability signals, social links, and detected web technologies before outreach.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/b2b-lead-contact-tech-enricher`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/b2b-lead-contact-tech-enricher) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify B2B Lead Contact & Tech Stack Enricher** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "ca10b385-e619-4f87-a6dd-0ca8a5dfeba4",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **B2B Lead Contact & Tech Stack Enricher** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "32af428f-bb97-446b-aed6-b2c071a5604b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "4e38d671-14f2-402c-a72f-56fe1333a4e3",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
